HOW IT WORKS
────────────

STEM PathfindR is an AI-powered gamified STEM career discovery platform that
helps high school and college students find their ideal STEM career through
interactive simulations, real-time labor market data, and a full interview
preparation suite.

The platform flow:

  1. ONBOARD    — Students take a 5-step quiz or upload their resume for AI
                  profile extraction via AWS Bedrock (Claude 3.5 Sonnet).

  2. DISCOVER   — The AI matches students with personalized career
                  recommendations from 9 fully-developed STEM career paths.

  3. SIMULATE   — Students enter immersive AI-generated day-in-the-life
                  scenarios, make branching decisions, and earn XP + badges.

  4. ANALYZE    — A live Market Intelligence dashboard powered by Bureau of
                  Labor Statistics (BLS) API v2 shows real salary projections,
                  geographic demand heatmaps, and career viability scores.

  5. PREPARE    — The Interview Intelligence Suite provides:
                    • Smart Resume Engine — PDF upload → ATS scoring → keyword
                      gap analysis → AI-optimized resume generation
                    • AI Mock Interview — Video + Web Speech API transcription +
                      real-time body language analysis (TensorFlow.js MoveNet)
                    • Technical Assessment — Coding problems with in-browser
                      execution (JS + Python via Pyodide WASM) + AI code review

  6. PROGRESS   — Students level up, collect achievement badges, and refine
                  their career direction over time.

